Schism is a [[Bestiary/Kaathe|Kaathe]] who travels with [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. He was kept and studied by the [[Org/The Fifth Prosperous Empire of the Sundom|Sundom]], and his design was copied for the thirteenth realm; once the work had what it needed from him, he was set aside. He has been present at decisions that shaped the Sundom's later projects.

He is eager about old and powerful things. The divine presence in [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin|the lava ruin]] delighted him, and he pressed the Weft to let him study it, offering to break off whatever useful pieces they did not want. He sulks when the others brush him aside, and [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] has become his clear favourite among them.
